WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.793
Multiplying a fraction by a whole number means several equal fractional groups; use

00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:05.853
strips to model.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:14.231
Calculate 2/8 of 32. The answer is 8. One 8th of 32 is 4; multiply by 2 to get 8.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:21.009
4/6 of 24 reading cards are used in a craft workshop. How many cards is that? Pause

00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:22.415
to choose and explain.

00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:29.369
4/6 of 24 reading cards are used in a craft workshop. How many cards is that? The

00:00:29.369 --> 00:00:34.739
answer is 16. One 6th of 24 is 4; multiply by 4 to get 16.
